les and parameters.\n\nPutting it all together, the playbook starts with \'---\', then a list of tasks. Each task has \'name\', \'action\', \'loop\', \'when\' conditions, \'notify\' for the second task.\n\nI think that\'s all. Now, I\'ll write the YAML accordingly, ensuring proper formatting and adherence to the instructions.\n</think>\n\n```\n---\n- name: Create document root directories for virtual hosts\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item.documentroot }}"\n    state: directory\n    mode: 0755\n  with_items: httpd_vhosts\n  when:\n    - httpd_vhosts is defined\n    - item.documentroot is defined\n    - item.create_docroot | default(true) | bool\n  ignore_errors: yes\n\n- name: Configure virtual hosts\n  template:\n    src: vhost_conf_template\n    dest: "{{ httpd_vhosts_directory }}/{{ item.name }}.conf"\n    mode: 0644\n  with_items: httpd_vhosts\n  notify:\n    - Test httpd configuration validity\n    - Restart httpd\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-11T01:27:39.293783324Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10201518757, 'load_duration': 98330285, 'prompt_eval_count': 462, 'prompt_eval_duration': 107577540, 'eval_count': 674, 'eval_duration': 9993735421, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--ad7f1402-9f34-4693-9b21-a4e33e9e2bc5-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 462, 'output_tokens': 674, 'total_tokens': 1136}
