content='<think>\nOkay, I need to create an Ansible Playbook based on the user\'s instructions. The playbook has to adhere strictly to the given tasks and structure. Let me go through each task step by step.\n\nFirst, the playbook must start with \'---\' on the first line, so I\'ll include that. Then, each task needs to be in the correct order without any additional headers like hosts or vars.\n\nTask 1 is about migrating from adoptopenjdk to temurin if selected. I\'ll set the fact `java_jdk_vendor` to "temurin" if it\'s currently "adoptopenjdk" using the set_fact module.\n\nNext, Task 2 requires gathering OS-specific variables based on certain facts. I\'ll use include_vars to pull in variables from the current directory.\n\nTask 3 is about architecture-specific variables. I\'ll include another file named \'architecture.yml\' using include_vars again.\n\nFor Task 4 and 5, I need to set OS and architecture-specific variables. I\'ll use set_fact with default values if variables aren\'t defined yet.\n\nTask 6 sets the `java_home` fact to the value of `java_open_jdk_home`, so I\'ll use set_fact for that.\n\nMoving on to Debian-specific tasks: Task 7 removes deprecated repositories. I\'ll use apt module with state=absent. Then, Task 8 installs extra apt tools if specified. I\'ll use apt with state=present.\n\nTask 9 and 10 add required key repositories and apt repositories for Debian. I\'ll use apt_key and apt_repository modules respectively.\n\nFor RedHat systems, Task 11 and 12 handle key repositories and yum repositories. I\'ll use rpm_key and yum with the appropriate variables.\n\nTask 13 installs required libs using package manager based on the OS. I\'ll use apt or yum depending on the distribution.\n\nTasks 14 and 15 install Java on Debian and RedHat using apt and yum modules with the specified package and version.\n\nTask 16 creates a template for environment variables. I\'ll use template module to create /etc/profile.d/jdk.sh.\n\nTask 17 sources the profile to apply changes. I\'ll execute bash commands to source the file.\n\nFinally, Tasks 18 and 19 handle setting the correct Java alternatives on Debian for versions less than and greater than or equal to 11. I\'ll use alternatives module accordingly.\n\nI\'ll make sure each task is correctly ordered and uses the right modules and variables as specified. Now, I\'ll structure the YAML playbook accordingly, ensuring it\'s valid and fits into an Ansible Role\'s tasks/main.yml file.\n</think>\n\n```yaml\n---\n- name: Migrate from adoptopenjdk to temurin if selected\n  set_fact:\n    java_jdk_vendor: "temurin"\n  when: ansible_distribution == "Debian" and java_jdk_vendor == "adoptopenjdk"\n\n- name: Gather OS specific variables\n  include_vars:\n    file: "{{ java_jdk_vendor }}/{{ ansible_distribution }}/{{ ansible_distribution_major_version }}"\n\n- name: Gather architecture specific variables\n  include_vars:\n    file: architecture.yml\n\n- name: Set OS specific variables (I)\n  set_fact:\n    java_open_jdk_version: "{{ java_open_jdk_version | default(\'8\') }}"\n    java_open_jdk_repository: "{{ java_open_jdk_repository | default(\'\') }}"\n    java_open_jdk_key_repository: "{{ java_open_jdk_key_repository | default(\'\') }}"\n    java_open_jdk_apt_extra_packages: "{{ java_open_jdk_apt_extra_packages | default([]) }}"\n    java_deprecated_repositories_adoptopenjdk: "{{ java_deprecated_repositories_adoptopenjdk | default([]) }}"\n\n- name: Set OS and architecture specific variables (II)\n  set_fact:\n    java_open_jdk_home_dir: "{{ java_open_jdk_home_dir | default(\'/usr/lib/jvm/java-{{ java_open_jdk_version }}/\') }}"\n    java_open_jdk_package: "{{ java_open_jdk_package | default(\'openjdk-{{ java_open_jdk_version }}-jdk\') }}"\n\n- name: Set specific variables\n  set_fact:\n    java_home: "{{ java_open_jdk_home_dir }}"\n\n- name: Remove deprecated repositories (Debian)\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ item }}"\n    state: absent\n  loop: "{{ java_deprecated_repositories_adoptopenjdk }}"\n\n- name: Install extra apt tools (Debian)\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  loop: "{{ java_open_jdk_apt_extra_packages }}"\n\n- name: Add required key repositories (Debian)\n  apt_key:\n    key: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  loop: "{{ java_required_key_repositories_openjdk }}"\n\n- name: Add required repositories (Debian)\n  apt_repository:\n    repo: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  loop: "{{ java_required_repositories_openjdk }}"\n\n- name: Add required key repositories (RedHat)\n  rpm_key:\n    key: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  loop: "{{ java_required_key_repositories_openjdk }}"\n\n- name: Add required repositories (RedHat)\n  yum:\n    name: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  loop: "{{ java_required_repositories_openjdk }}"\n\n- name: Install required libs\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  when: ansible_distribution == "Debian"\n  loop: "{{ java_required_libs_openjdk }}"\n  ignore_errors: yes\n\n  yum:\n    name: "{{ item }}"\n    state: present\n  when: ansible_distribution == "RedHat"\n  loop: "{{ java_required_libs_openjdk }}"\n  ignore_errors: yes\n\n- name: Install Java (Debian)\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ java_open_jdk_package }}"\n    version: "{{ java_open_jdk_version }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Install Java (RedHat)\n  yum:\n    name: "{{ java_open_jdk_package }}"\n    version: "{{ java_open_jdk_version }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Export environment variables\n  template:\n    src: jdk.sh.j2\n    dest: /etc/profile.d/jdk.sh\n\n- name: Source environment variables\n  shell: source /etc/profile\n\n- name: Correct java version selected (Debian, Java < 11)\n  alternatives:\n    name: java\n    path: "{{ java_open_jdk_home_dir }}/bin/java"\n    priority: 1\n    state: set\n  when: java_open_jdk_version is version < \'11\' and ansible_distribution == "Debian"\n\n- name: Correct java version selected (Debian, Java >= 11)\n  alternatives:\n    name: java\n    path: "{{ java_open_jdk_home_dir }}/bin/java"\n    priority: 1\n    state: set\n  when: java_open_jdk_version is version >= \'11\' and ansible_distribution == "Debian"\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-11T01:37:37.240191121Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 23651071465, 'load_duration': 85780438, 'prompt_eval_count': 1001, 'prompt_eval_duration': 337691050, 'eval_count': 1459, 'eval_duration': 23225825404, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--ad272949-d80b-4e15-9e95-dcc3f19b43ea-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1001, 'output_tokens': 1459, 'total_tokens': 2460}
